speechtext:
Mr. McCann moves:
That resolution No. 1 of the budget resolutions relating to the customs tariff be amended by deleting therefrom items 390 , 390a and 390b and by substituting therefor the following;
Customs tariff-390. Castings, of iron or steel, in the rough, n.o.p.; British preferential tariff, 15 per cent; most favoured nation tariff, 25 per cent; general tariff, 27J per cent.
